' Style et participants partages par les diagrammes de sequence (sequence-0X-*.puml)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
autonumber

actor "Visiteur·se /\nApprenant·e" as User
participant "Frontend (SPA)" as FE
participant "API (Express)" as API
participant "Service metier" as Svc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
